   "version": "Introduced in Senate",
   "date": "2018-03-22",
   "text": "Arbitration Fairness Act of 2018\n This bill prohibits a predispute arbitration agreement from being valid or enforceable if it requires arbitration of an employment dispute, consumer dispute, antitrust dispute, or civil rights dispute."
